[{"title":"题梅竹图","author":"家铉翁","text":"余家乎岷之下兮，有梅萧萧，有竹森森。\n今洎乎瀛之野兮，秋草萋萋，黄沙冥冥。\n有怀彼美兮在天一垠，梦不可即兮聊因其似而记其真。\n真兮似兮，岂墨君笔史之可寻。\n皓兮苍兮，吾独想其岁寒之心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52901,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题雪花达摩布衣偈","author":"家铉翁","text":"拈花公案且莫道，西来正被拈花恼。\n一花开后几花开，微笑不禁成绝倒。\n归去来，人未老，掉下从前旧草鞋。\n衲被蒙头面壁坐，提起不直一落索。\n放下大地无处著，从来被他碍手脚。\n为君索火当街烧，布袋依前是弥勒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52902,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题蒋同知所藏马图前后凡五","author":"家铉翁","text":"行而前者骊与皇，从而后者骍与驹。\n匪双匪驷良马五，画出人间五马图。\n祝君出典大藩牧，愿君旗旄旌节耀前驱。\n古来共说人生五马贵，况复盛年劲气绿鬓长眉须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52903,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠云山逸人刘巨川瞽而谈命","author":"家铉翁","text":"世人具眼知多少，见山不知云山好。\n斯人背境自观心，识破云山千万层。\n须知万物备于我，高下散殊何往而非道。\n善观物者观以心，目所未见心已瞭。\n闻君学易多历年，妙处能探造化先。\n维艮之背不与事物对，物具一极常与此心会。\n君知云山云山亦知君，是之谓行其庭不见其人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52904,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠河间隐者苑君年八十有一","author":"家铉翁","text":"海上有三山，瀛洲居其一。\n何年飞来神州赤县东，其上至今犹有神仙宅。\n庞眉皓首方瞳翁，乔松羡门乃其匹。\n深衣大带儒中仙，不读黄庭读周易。\n乾元用九独探数之原，九九妙契乾策八十一。\n万事万物从此始，衍之又衍至于千百亿。\n寿翁以金书玉箓长生符，不若寿翁以邵子先天周子一太极。\n梅边生意浩无穷，坐阅人间蟠桃几回实。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52905,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠谈命王逸民","author":"家铉翁","text":"逸民古称避世士，不以功名累其意。\n有人向彼话穷通，拂衣归来洗其耳。\n君字逸民见君心，云胡乃以谈天为己事。\n要令世间竞进人，稍知山林岩壑味。\n吁嗟逸民莫学商山翁，商山卒为三聘起。\n成都卜隐老君平，身处涧槃名声动朝市。\n案头周易是本经，未来千载瞭然在胸次。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52906,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠谈故人高鹏举","author":"家铉翁","text":"东邻歌呼闹如市，西邻笙箫正鼎沸。\n高生择术颇可人，夜阑挑灯说书史。\n说出忠臣烈士报国心，四座闻者为堕泪。\n闻君年少曾读书，壮大无成乃与优伶俱。\n左手执籥右秉翟，念到简兮应嗟吁。\n他年了却官中呼，仍作书生挟册归里闾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52907,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠隐者忘机 其一","author":"家铉翁","text":"寂然不动机已兆，感而遂通机乃神。\n一阳昨夜回冰底，生意流行万象春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52908,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"墨梅 其二","author":"家铉翁","text":"冰崖孤芳，雪林早春。\n伴我读易，见天地心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52909,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"墨梅 其一","author":"家铉翁","text":"非香之香，非色之色。\n伴我孤吟，风清月白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52910,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 题旅舍壁","author":"家铉翁","text":"瀛台居北界，觌面是重城。\n老龙蹲踞不动，潭影净无尘。\n此地高阳胜处，天付仙翁为主，那肯借闲人。\n暂挂西堂锡，仍同旦过宾。\n六年里，五迁舍，得比邻。\n儒馆豆笾于粲，弦诵有遗音。\n甚喜黄冠为侣，更得青衿来伴，应不叹飘零。\n夜宿东华榻，朝餐泮水芹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52911,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"念奴娇 其二 送陈正言","author":"家铉翁","text":"南来数骑，问征尘、正是江头风恶。\n耿耿孤忠磨不尽，惟有老天知得。\n短棹浮淮。\n轻毡渡汉，回首觚棱泣。\n缄书欲上，惊传天外清跸。\n路人指示荒台，昔汉家使者，曾留行迹。\n我节君袍雪样明，俯仰都无愧色。\n送子先归，慈颜未老，三径有馀乐。\n逢人问我，为说肝肠如昨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52912,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耆英会 其二","author":"席汝言","text":"壮岁尘埃禄事牵，老归重到旧林泉。\n曾无勋业书青史，偶向康宁养老年。\n自分杜门居陋巷，敢期序齿预公筵。\n更惭形秽才凉薄，不称图真接钜贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52913,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耆英会 其一","author":"席汝言","text":"系国安危唐上宰，功成身退汉留侯。\n二公闲暇开高宴，九老雍容奉胜流。\n共接雅欢恩意洽，不矜崇贵礼容优。\n赏心乐事人间盛，岂谓今稀古莫俦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52914,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题酒家壁","author":"席炎","text":"山云出山无一钱，日日醉倒春风边。\n采蘋桥南徐孺子，白酒初熟留神仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52915,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次令衿游玉壶高咏十绝 其九 久病便觉清快","author":"席羲叟","text":"内熟先从一念收，浩然勿药更何求。\n西山故自朝来爽，政不惊人语不休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52916,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次令衿游玉壶高咏十绝 其五 小雨垂帘就寝","author":"席羲叟","text":"篆香如雾细萦帘，始信壶中别有天。\n客舍黄粱今熟否，邯郸无梦梦游仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52917,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次令衿游玉壶高咏十绝 其一 风雷大作","author":"席羲叟","text":"坐听风雷起空谷，俄看四面野云生。\n道人不作英雄气，可笑当年失箸惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52918,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次令衿游玉壶高咏十绝 其三 处处可人","author":"席羲叟","text":"陂塘五月迎秋爽，脩竹成阴一径开。\n俗客自应惭到此，幽深雅称杖藜来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52919,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次令衿游玉壶高咏十绝 其十 对换","author":"席羲叟","text":"绝景频因警句誇，莫传俚耳便纷挐。\n须知味道耽岩穴，志意难将富贵加。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52920,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次令衿游玉壶高咏十绝 其六 凭栏看花","author":"席羲叟","text":"湖光空阔水天秋，翠盖红衣永日留。\n惟有诗情磨不尽，碧云吟就喜汤休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52921,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次令衿游玉壶高咏十绝 其二 独坐","author":"席羲叟","text":"几槛虚明不著埃，忘机鸥鸟自飞来。\n北窗高卧羲皇世，九陌红尘安在哉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52922,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次令衿游玉壶高咏十绝 其七 欲归甫留","author":"席羲叟","text":"度堑昏鸦接翅稀，断霞相映雾山微。\n驺车不用飞青盖，试作山翁倒载归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52923,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次令衿游玉壶高咏十绝 其八 满园秋香","author":"席羲叟","text":"黄金匀揉万英开，步绕清芬过砌台。\n一笑欣然超鼻观，知公曾到月中来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52924,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次令衿游玉壶高咏十绝 其四 解衣磐","author":"席羲叟","text":"林宗乌帻任攲倾，缓带荷风拂面清。\n城市轮蹄闹如织，飘然从此便登瀛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52925,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"徐一山","text":"一见青山便是家，苦无人可共烟霞。\n枯肠不受春风腻，莫汲花边水煮茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52926,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上","author":"徐一山","text":"堤上柳依依，柳风吹絮飞。\n帝京三月尽，客子几时归。\n山近鸟栖早，花残人买稀。\n尽多湖水在，谁与浣尘衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52927,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"摸鱼儿","author":"徐一初","text":"对茱萸、一年一度。\n龙山今在何处。\n参军莫道无勋业，消得从容尊俎。\n君看取。\n便破帽飘零，也博名千古。\n当年幕府。\n知多少时流，等闲收拾，有个客如许。\n追往事，满目山河晋土。\n征鸿又过边羽。\n登临莫上高层望，怕见故宫禾黍。\n觞绿醑。\n浇万斛牢愁，泪阁新亭雨。\n黄花无语。\n毕竟是西风，朝来披拂，犹忆旧时主。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52928,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送唐介谪英州","author":"徐九思","text":"投荒万里岭南行，莫叩天阍诉不平。\n忠谠若教无窜逐，奸邪何计窃安荣。\n一封疏在铭周鼎，三黜名高重汉京。\n最是中霄雷激烈，为君特地发冤声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52929,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灵岩一线天","author":"徐几","text":"尽日摩挲藓石斑，几人来此驻吟鞍。\n谁知一线通天处，照见人心凛凛寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52930,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"狮子峰","author":"徐几","text":"举首朝天据洞扉，怪形蹲踞类狻猊。\n山中弹压无豺虎，留得孤猿半夜啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52931,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天壶","author":"徐几","text":"老松压石洞门耸，青萝曳树牵云影。\n天然物外清修地，岩头残月沈丹井。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52932,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茉莉花","author":"徐千里","text":"炎洲绿女雪为肌，十二朱阑月未移。\n香逼簟纹眠不得，为渠醒过打钟时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52933,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题钓台","author":"徐大正","text":"光武初从血战回，故人长短尚论材。\n中霄若起唐虞兴，未必先生恋钓台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52934,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入石桥路林木蓊郁但闻涧声潺潺忽惊湍飞雹骇绿纷红杂然而下口占二绝句 其二","author":"徐大受","text":"琮琤林涧只听闻，想见萦崖络石纹。\n忽作惊湍溅飞雹，半随花雨落纷纷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52935,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入石桥路林木蓊郁但闻涧声潺潺忽惊湍飞雹骇绿纷红杂然而下口占二绝句 其一","author":"徐大受","text":"略彴微分碧玉湾，杖藜穿破郁蓝天。\n山深草木春无路，时有藤花一树妍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52936,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方外诗友机空二禅娄诧莲峰五月梅雨深林丛薄中娑罗花特异每以未见为恨夏初过此而桥东是花豫开岂应真大士出此以相劳耶","author":"徐大受","text":"九葩一萼鹤翎红，开落梅黄烟雨中。\n千叶青莲无路到，不知春在石桥东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52937,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归路过福圣观瀑布辉老踞坐盘石二绝题飞雨亭 其二","author":"徐大受","text":"一水高悬千尺梭，空林终日影婆娑。\n仰天雄踞盘陀石，尊者真身诺巨那。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52938,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归路过福圣观瀑布辉老踞坐盘石二绝题飞雨亭 其一","author":"徐大受","text":"电激河翻白雨飞，青烟紫雾落斜晖。\n山中道士秘泉石，只到此亭牵客衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52939,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入万年谒简庵清老追和曾使君诗板韵","author":"徐大受","text":"踏破深崖苍石棱，八峰来谒简庵清。\n山花照座一两点，雪狖叫云三四声。\n诗带烟霞藏旧刻，门开楼阁见经行。\n平田浅草归时路，风月依然度百城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52940,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送辉老自赤城住圣水","author":"徐大受","text":"道人去住本无心，云出空山鹤在阴。\n试问白莲同净社，何如赤壁卧青林。\n叫群孤雁水天阔，啼雪冷猿岩洞深。\n要勘山门骑佛殿，春风杖锡傥来临。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52941,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游石桥至塔头路","author":"徐大受","text":"招手晴云豁，妙高峰顶头。\n竹舆摇午梦，茗椀唤春愁。\n俎豆罗千嶂，虚空起一沤。\n危栏闲徙倚，万象入冥搜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52942,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题林咏道浮江别业","author":"徐大受","text":"密林凝昼寂，一叶动须惊。\n砌净飞花影，池深落果声。\n正宜铺枕簟，且复倒瓶罂。\n向晚催归急，烟江野艇横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52943,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"超览堂","author":"徐大忠","text":"君侯雅有博大见，胸次不使倥偬蚀。\n一朝放步城东南，超然神会而心得。\n咄嗟高栋倚层空，振古奇观今未识。\n桃花春暖意如迷，冻雨声来云泼墨。\n天青一纸雁横书，雪白千林梅著色。\n四筵有客无留觞，万事不来咸得职。\n鸿笔昭代今文宗，危言劘上古遗直。\n愿冯英略决筹帷，净扫妖氛清八极。\n缘知此景不须恋，留与邦人勤爱惜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52944,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺谢文二子文武登科","author":"徐子元","text":"福畤何曾好誉儿，凤毛争奈一时奇。\n青钱学士如龙友，白马将军似虎痴。\n齐展一双文武手，共扶千载圣明时。\n从来谢砌无闲草，步步芳兰亚紫芝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52945,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岩桂花","author":"徐介轩","text":"翠叶金华小胆瓶，轻拈微嗅不胜情。\n从教失陷沈烟冷，蓦地薰心梦也清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52946,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"徐介轩","text":"香梅烂漫见红梅，白白朱朱取次开。\n料得故园春色满，有人花下正徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52947,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菊花","author":"徐介轩","text":"独向邻园看菊回，隔篱惊见一枝梅。\n西风怜我太寂寞，特地遣花将句来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52948,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桐","author":"徐介轩","text":"灏气行秋万宇凉，玄姑新敕办衣裳。\n林为机杼织无迹，月当膏油缉易长。\n谓尔索裘虽有日，到头无褐可禁霜。\n工夫只有琵琶索，又在梧桐夜雨旁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52949,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红梅 其一","author":"徐介轩","text":"寒梅冷艳缀轻枝，误认夭桃未放时。\n盛饰霓裳陪越女，不施粉黛抹胭脂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52950,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又赠术士薛镜台二首 其二","author":"徐元杰","text":"始吾为养喜徼荣，今恨孤孱感慨增。\n白发满头何所用，只存忧愿数年登。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52951,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又赠术士薛镜台二首 其一","author":"徐元杰","text":"儒流今以术为资，满腹星躔洞隐微。\n自号镜台须自照，逢人休浪泄天机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52952,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丫头岩","author":"徐元杰","text":"丫头不是女丫鬟，把作坚牢担拄看。\n撑定东南天半壁，镇教双耸碧云端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52953,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大巧","author":"徐元杰","text":"大巧工夫本不全，清光凿破未教圆。\n岂无妙补苍穹手，修满冰轮送上天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52954,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行","author":"徐元杰","text":"步绕青秧绿水间，春畦交错路回环。\n老翁牵得牛当路，恐碍人行却复还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52955,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以琴送郡守二首 其二","author":"徐元杰","text":"天朝交口重声名，公自翛然物外情。\n氓有焦桐旌往恋，当年靖献与俱清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52956,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以琴送郡守二首 其一","author":"徐元杰","text":"诗翁雅镇玉溪山，褒玺飞来玉节还。\n为报佳音天日近，南薰殿里正催班。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52957,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"讯剑浦主簿詹栋斋","author":"徐元杰","text":"竹林饥午隐禅扉，合傍鸾栖亦此栖。\n时一参寮茶供罢，可能无语到双溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52958,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初夏","author":"徐元杰","text":"横波泪竹纹铺簟，叠雪轻罗香剪衣。\n清夏槐生风细细，新秋麦涨雨霏霏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52959,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"村家","author":"徐元杰","text":"疏烟落日路三叉，败叶乾风屋数家。\n场圃毕工梁月出，傍檐红女绩丝麻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52960,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"来青书院桃花","author":"徐元杰","text":"塞满乾坤本是仁，更无一物不洪钧。\n山桃自不知粗俗，也与梅花斗早春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52961,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和怀玉本老","author":"徐元杰","text":"失脚天台绝顶峰，又来怀玉乱山中。\n琼桥去后无消息，禅月重重有案公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52962,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和李文溪送青云道人归杭韵","author":"徐元杰","text":"丹成会见君身蜕，我欲从之更问天。\n唤醒横江孤鹤梦，凭君持此叩坡仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52963,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和汪君","author":"徐元杰","text":"胸次秋风涧底蘋，坐间那得此嘉宾。\n诗来香迸宵人屋，笑杀元规尘污人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52964,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"画龙","author":"徐元杰","text":"峥嵘头角见龙神，画者微茫画得真。\n一夜风雷捲将去，沛为膏泽下于民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52965,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊行","author":"徐元杰","text":"百花只被一晴催，一出郊行花尽开。\n携杖奚奴趁先去，路迷青草却回来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52966,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪","author":"徐元杰","text":"瓦声初听响疏疏，顷刻庭除百斛珠。\n寒雀不知来啄米，群鸡粥粥亦相呼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52967,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游鹫峰赠野堂和尚","author":"徐元杰","text":"目断天鹅影不留，梵风吹落鹫峰头。\n野堂四大无窗壁，散诞当年个野牛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52968,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上","author":"徐元杰","text":"花开红树乱莺啼，草长平湖白鹭飞。\n风物晴和人意好，夕阳箫鼓几船归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52969,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]